ereas the other seasons  were clearly about resurrecting his wife  this could be about killing her they are  of course both aliens and the pair might  rule over the planet like tyrants lots  of possibilities and as for my thoughts  on the series i think this was probably  my second favorite one season 2 is still  the top for me but this was brilliant  and it's so good being back with the  family they like this season all have  their bad points but overall they're  such a fun group to hang around with  that it's difficult not to have a blast  whether it's the opening dance number or  just the situation they find themselves  in i had a lot of fun even though i feel  the series did fall apart a bit towards  the end obviously the pandemic massively  affected this as well whereas in the  past we'd get lots of jumping around  locations through not only time but the  city this one becomes a bit stationary  still though i enjoyed what we got and  the character development numerous  twists and reveals that all build up  nicely on what's come before  kind of wild to me that both this and  the boys have been better than all the  other comic book shows by bigger studios  and i think they could learn a thing or  two from them in the end umbrella  academy season 3 was great and it gets  an 8 out of 10. i'd of course love to  hear your thoughts so make sure you  comment below and let me know we're in a  competition right now and giving away  three copies of everything everywhere  all at once on the 15th of july and all  you have to do to be on the chance of  winning is like the video make sure you  subscribe with notifications on and drop  a comment below with your thoughts on  the season we picked the victors a on  the 15 and the winners of the last one  are on screen right now say that's you  message me on twitter at heavyspoilers  if you want something else to watch then  make sure you check out our breakdown of  obi-wan which will be linked on screen  right now we went over th